that this place was just going to be another over-priced French Quarter tourist trap with below-average food, but I was pleasantly surprised. The menu was of decent size and was varied, and I really can't say anything bad about the food. I had the BLT and soft-shelled crab and it was delicious. My husband had the Cochon de Lait fries and gobbled them up. The service was fantastic. We came late on a Saturday night during Mardi Gras, expecting the servers to be dead-tired and grouchy and experienced quite the opposite. We sat at the bar and not only was the bartender attentive and speedy, but he was really nice and made great conversation. Since this is..."},{"business_id":"M7Y338g9JFs_0fNR1RA82w","review_id":"prY1JWqEv3rf_D4YbQ97Dg","date":"2015-04-20T14:45:51","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9309547543525696,"text_excerpt":"Great food! Good location - just off of bourbon street in the French quarter. The service was fast and friendly. We started with the BBQ pork fries - which are a must. Basically nachos but with fries and not chips. Pretty genius. I got the Louisiana chopped salad with shrimp and was throughly pleased. Number one part of this restaurant? Biggest local beer selection in town. Tried the NOLA blonde ale and it was delicious!"},{"business_id":"M7Y338g9JFs_0fNR1RA82w","review_id":"MqSsinV4KPuyIfPEc1zXmg","date":"2015-06-04T17:46:07","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9307820796966553,"text_excerpt":"This bar was conveniently located right next to our hotel so we came here several times. I was a big fan of their beer selection. They offer flights so I ordered the Hop one - great choices. Also, very generous with their flight serving sizes! And they come in a cute wooden fleur-de-lis. The food is OK here - the catfish wasn't anything special. My friend enjoyed his gumbo a great amount though. Still, there are so many awesome places to eat in the area - I'd probably stick to drinks here and maybe some appetizers. Service was good. The bartender even called us a cab to the airport on our departure date which helped us a lot."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"M7Y338g9JFs_0fNR1RA82w","photo_id":"MtnfyvtiZduNa38sPa5VJA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/MtnfyvtiZduNa38sPa5VJA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9276739954948425},{"business_id":"M7Y338g9JFs_0fNR1RA82w","photo_id":"7DlQSa14H_QrJvpi3KUmrw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/7DlQSa14H_QrJvpi3KUmrw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8600548505783081},{"business_id":"M7Y338g9JFs_0fNR1RA82w","photo_id":"HYb1TqRJcl4GgGKUhnsCkw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/HYb1TqRJcl4GgGKUhnsCkw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8579859137535095},{"business_id":"M7Y338g9JFs_0fNR1RA82w","photo_id":"Zgb8edaH-4MhduBE5P7m8Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Zgb8edaH-4MhduBE5P7m8Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8328808546066284},{"business_id":"M7Y338g9JFs_0fNR1RA82w","photo_id":"lW5kdQl2-CIn2zZ4fGxePg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/lW5kdQl2-CIn2zZ4fGxePg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.820205807685852}]},"notebook_case":null}
